# Replit
.cache/
.local/

# HandiEdge state (predictions, results, calibration, history, reports) is
# COMMITTED on purpose: the scheduled GitHub Actions run is the runtime, so the
# repo is where the daily output lives and where prediction history persists.
# Keeping the slates too preserves exactly what the model saw, for backtesting.
